&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:large;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/261qiushi&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;囚室#261主题版式&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
