&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;诶你都看到这里了啊那我就讲一讲吧&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;这里是&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605857173&quot; alt=&quot;Auroriaaaaa&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;Auroriaaaaa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;可以叫我馅饼 A酱 或者红酒烩土豆（随意称呼啦&lt;/li&gt;
