&lt;p&gt;小女孩人设好可爱，抱走了 ——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/e-u&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6176669&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605857173&quot; alt=&quot;E_U&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6176669)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/e-u&quot;  &gt;E_U&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
